Release v2.4
– New key `item-break` for `enumext*` and `keyans*`.
– Standard lists and environments can be used inside `enumext*` and `keyans*`.
– Fixes in `\setenumext`, `\printkeyans`, `mini-env` and `base-fix`.
– Update code for _tagged_ PDF.
– Common layout for messages and new regression tests.
